<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Featured on Hugo Bootstrap Theme</title><link>https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/tags/featured/</link><description>Recent content in Featured on Hugo Bootstrap Theme</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><copyright>Open-source &lt;a class="text-muted text-decoration-none" href="https://github.com/filipecarneiro/hugo-bootstrap-theme/blob/main/LICENSE"&gt;MIT&lt;/a&gt; Licensed.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:34:46 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/tags/featured/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Structured Data Demo 🔎</title><link>https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/page/structured-data-demo/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/page/structured-data-demo/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="structured-data-demo"&gt;Structured Data Demo&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This page exists to exercise the page-level JSON-LD partials that ship with the
theme, so their output is validated on every build rather than only when a real
site happens to configure them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three schemas are emitted from the front matter above:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://schema.org/Product" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Product&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/strong&gt; — via &lt;code&gt;product:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://schema.org/SoftwareApplication" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;SoftwareApplication&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/strong&gt; — via &lt;code&gt;softwareApplication:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://schema.org/FAQPage" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;FAQPage&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/strong&gt; — via &lt;code&gt;faq:&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The site-level schemas (&lt;code&gt;WebSite&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Organization&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;LocalBusiness&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Event&lt;/code&gt;)
are configured in &lt;code&gt;config/_default/params.toml&lt;/code&gt; and render on the home page.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bootstrap Carousel 🎠</title><link>https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/page/bootstrap-carousel/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2022 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://filipecarneiro.github.io/hugo-bootstrap-theme/page/bootstrap-carousel/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="bootstrap-carousel"&gt;Bootstrap Carousel&lt;/h1&gt;
